  ProjectTesting: @project/testing/INDEX.sdd
  ProjectCoverage: @project/testing/coverage.sdd
  ProjectRuns: @project/testing/runs/
  ProjectFailures: @project/testing/failures/
  ProjectExceptions: @project/testing/exceptions/

State: +
  Note:
  L0-L5 test levels are distinct from SecurityLevel L0-L5 and
  workflow test levels T0-T7. This file defines HOW DEEP testing
  goes for a task. The workflow/testing.sdd defines WHEN each
  test type runs in the SDLC.
